// ----------------------------------------------------------------
// OV-115 .. OV-120: KPI fmt() (AC-15.2)
// ----------------------------------------------------------------
_ov_case OV-115 `"dash kpi mean(mpg), name(k) title(T) fmt(bogus)"' 198 fmt
_ov_case OV-116 `"dash kpi mean(mpg), name(k) title(T) fmt("HACKED" %9.2f)"' 198 fmt
