// The not-found message echoes the name without single quotes, so a
// trailing double quote cannot end the compound quote early.
_ov_case OV-134 `"dash scatter mpg weight, by("foreign") name(ov134)"' 111 by
_ov_said OV-134m `"variable "foreign" not found"'

// S1 -- a two-variable plot type given ONE variable is refused at
