// ----------------------------------------------------------------
// OV-142 .. OV-145: the scheme kind (WP-17).  A shipped scheme or theme
// name passes as written -- the renderer lower-cases it itself -- and a
// name that is neither, nor a .scheme file in the working directory, is
// refused here.  The working-directory cases live in
// test_custom_scheme.cscript, which builds one.
// ----------------------------------------------------------------
_ov_case OV-142 `"dash scatter mpg weight, scheme(s2color) name(ov142)"' 0 ""
