// U24-5 (WP-31 D1): ##N on a major option.  twoway takes it, rc 0, and
// notes "##5 ignored, only allowed for minor ticks"; dash takes it and
// prints the same note when it draws the graph (the immediate route), and
// writes the option to the spec as typed.
local bad ""
